      "properties": {},
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "title": "Front, side and back to .vox with Hunyuan3D-2mv",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Front, side and back to .vox with Hunyuan3D-2mv\n1. Upload the front picture on **Front View**, the profile on **Side View** and the subject from behind on **Back View**, all with the background in alpha and at the same pixel scale.\n2. Keep **side_faces** on `left`: the side goes through the left output into Hunyuan's left view.\n3. Set **maximum_size** on **Save Voxel Model**: the voxels along the model's longest axis.\n4. Press **Run**, then **Download** on Save Voxel Model. **Preview Mesh** shows the shape.\n\nWithout a back picture, select **Back View** and **Encode Back** and press Ctrl+B.\n\nHunyuan3D-2mv makes the shape only, every voxel takes **fallback_color**. The model comes out solid and standing, turned a quarter around its vertical axis.\n\nThe KSampler is set for the turbo checkpoint, 10 steps at cfg 1. With `hunyuan3d-dit-v2-mv_fp16.safetensors` raise steps to about 30 and cfg to about 5.\n\nEvery Run uses a new seed; set control_after_generate to fixed to repeat one."
      ]
    }
